{"articleNo":"118468","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=118468&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[생활관]2014학년도 동계방학 생활관 합격자 발표 및 등록 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.12.05","hit":"3706","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">2014학년도 동계방학 생활관 합격자를 발표하오니 생활관비를 기한내에 납부하시기 바랍니다.</span></font></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">※ 생활관 합격자 확인 : [원스톱서비스 - 학생지원 - 생활관 - 신청결과] 에서 확인</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">1. 납부기간</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: rgb(0,0,255); FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2014. 12. 5(금) ~ 12. 10(수) 16:00까지</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2. 납부은행</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : 농협은행 전국지점</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">3. 고지서 출력</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : 원스톱서비스-생활관-생활관비 고지내역 조회/출력</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">4. 농협 방문 납부 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">: 고지서 지참하여 납부(은행 영업시간 10:00~16:00)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">5. 개인별 가상계좌번호로 생활관비 계좌이체 납부시</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- 인터넷뱅킹, 폰뱅킹 무통장입금 등 가능(이체수수료 발생 가능)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: rgb(9,0,255); FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">받는 사람(학생 본인 이름) 필히 확인</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- 보내는 사람은 학생 이름이 아니라도 상관없음</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: rgb(9,0,255); FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">가상계좌번호는 매학기 변경됨</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">6. 생활관비 납부 확인 방법</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- 은행 확인 : 실시간</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: rgb(9,0,255); FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">학교 확인 : 납부 다음날 10:00 이후(원스톱서비스-생활관-납부내역 조회)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: rgb(102,102,102); FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">-</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: rgb(244,0,0); FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> 납부기간 내 미등록자는 별도의 통보없이 합격을 취소함</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">7. 문의</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : 푸름관(478-7943, 7944), 오름관(478-7201, 7202) </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2014. 12. 5.</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">금오공과대학교생활관</span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
